{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "anchor": "bi-monthly-backup-policy",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Bi-monthly Backup Policy"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "This policy creates a remote snapshot every two months and retains them for up to 6 months, ensuring a balance between storage conservation and restore availability."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "scheduler-configuration",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Scheduler Configuration"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "scheduler-configuration",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Snapshot Frequency: Every two months on the 1st day at 17:00 UTC"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "scheduler-configuration",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Months: February, April, June, August, October, December"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "scheduler-configuration",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Retention Rule: Keep all snapshots for the last 6 months"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "scheduler-configuration",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Time Window: The backup window runs daily from 07:00 to 19:00 UTC. This policy only uses it to scope execution."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-timeline-1-year",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Snapshot Timeline (1 Year)"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-timeline-1-year",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Let’s break it down over one calendar year:"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-timeline-1-year",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Snapshots are taken on: - Feb 1, Apr 1, Jun 1, Aug 1, Oct 1, Dec 1"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-timeline-1-year",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "At any given time, up to 3 most recent snapshots will be retained, due to the 6-month retention rule. - Example: In July, only Feb 1, Apr 1, and Jun 1 snapshots remain."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-timeline-1-year",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Total retained snapshots after 1 year:"
    },
